summary: Configure fence kdump.
description: |+
    The test case is to configure 2 cluster nodes for fence kdump

    Parameters:
    - USE_ALIAS
        Whether to use host alias or hostname in pacemaker configurations
        Default is false.
    - READ_FROM_PCS
        Whether to read fence kdump nodes from pcs configurations.
        When it's false, it would set fence_kdump_nodes explicitly in /etc/kdump.conf
        Default is true.


contact: Kdump QE <kdump-qe-list@redhat.com>
test: chmod a+x ./runtest.sh; ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
    - pcs 
    - pacemaker 
    - fence-agents-kdump
    - expect
    - kexec-tools
duration: 90m
extra-summary: /kernel/kdump/config-fence
extra-task: /kernel/kdump/config-fence
